{"4069530": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Thieves Party", "steam_appid": 4069530, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                     <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069530/extras/7a682784ab053c0344e28b95ac3ca459.avif?t=1772096267\" width=529 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Living is expensive. Like… <i>really</i> expensive. Your wallet is empty. The landlord is not patient.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So what’s the plan? Steal to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069530/extras/18cc9158f7c99717a632f20383881ce8.poster.avif?t=1772096267\" width=1170 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069530/extras/18cc9158f7c99717a632f20383881ce8.webm?t=1772096267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069530/extras/18cc9158f7c99717a632f20383881ce8.mp4?t=1772096267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                       <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069530/extras/955502c991c52c7fc7594c836f79dcad.avif?t=1772096267\" width=501 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sneak into places and make sure you don't get caught, hide behind big objects, or run in the hallways from the cop. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069530/extras/671f49e8b884a5bae9eb84ea33b0e6d4.poster.avif?t=1772096267\" width=1170 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069530/extras/671f49e8b884a5bae9eb84ea33b0e6d4.webm?t=1772096267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069530/extras/671f49e8b884a5bae9eb84ea33b0e6d4.mp4?t=1772096267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>       <br>                           <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069530/extras/f0efd977d53a84da7d00f555e4a79224.avif?t=1772096267\" width=503 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   Be aware that stepping into a camera range will trigger a really loud alarm that pretty much announces to the whole world (and the cops) that you’re there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069530/extras/2132cf98889c72b3bcd6fe2b14b716fc.poster.avif?t=1772096267\" width=1170 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069530/extras/2132cf98889c72b3bcd6fe2b14b716fc.webm?t=1772096267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069530/extras/2132cf98889c72b3bcd6fe2b14b716fc.mp4?t=1772096267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  <br>                                                 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069530/extras/caaa6998edfab010433bc1dd48c45786.avif?t=1772096267\" width=364 height=69 /></span>               </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A pro never goes in empty-handed. The wrong move can ruin it, and suddenly, a simple job turns into a mess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069530/extras/e81c41d7e6f946ae0924c1c875f6ac58.poster.avif?t=1772096267\" width=1170 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069530/extras/e81c41d7e6f946ae0924c1c875f6ac58.webm?t=1772096267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069530/extras/e81c41d7e6f946ae0924c1c875f6ac58.mp4?t=1772096267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                     <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069530/extras/7a682784ab053c0344e28b95ac3ca459.avif?t=1772096267\" width=529 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Living is expensive. Like… <i>really</i> expensive. Your wallet is empty. The landlord is not patient.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So what’s the plan? Steal to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069530/extras/18cc9158f7c99717a632f20383881ce8.poster.avif?t=1772096267\" width=1170 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069530/extras/18cc9158f7c99717a632f20383881ce8.webm?t=1772096267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069530/extras/18cc9158f7c99717a632f20383881ce8.mp4?t=1772096267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                       <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069530/extras/955502c